{"slug":"lone-worker-app","title":"Lone Worker App","desc":"Use the best lone worker app to transform any smartphone into a personal SOS alarm to protect lone workers at the touch of a button.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Pro-App-Award-website-1.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Lone Worker App\",\"title\":\"Peoplesafe Pro App\",\"intro\":\"Transform any smartphone into a lone worker alarm using our award-winning lone worker phone app.\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eBS 8484:2022 accredited for lone working\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eSOS alarm with 3-second response time\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e24/7 support from professional control centre\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Pro-App-Award-website-1.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Pinpoint location\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Pinpoint-location.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Faster emergency responses\",\"heading\":\"Pinpoint location\",\"content\":\"Get staff locations within 5m² in an emergency in remote and built up areas thanks to a combination of GPS and Wi-Fi tracking alongside integration with What3Words.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/pro-app-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Check-in \\u0026 out\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/check-in-check-out.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Consistent updates\",\"heading\":\"Check-in \\u0026 out\",\"content\":\"Staff can check in and out of their working day or specific activities providing updates on their wellbeing.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/pro-app-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Discreet alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/discreet.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Don't raise suspicions\",\"heading\":\"Discreet alarm\",\"content\":\"Avoid escalating situations by raising an alarm without using the SOS button by pressing the power button or shaking the mobile device.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/pro-app-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Fall detection\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/fall-detection.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Raise an alarm hands-free\",\"heading\":\"Fall detection\",\"content\":\"Automatic alarm raised when a fall is detected. Staff can get help when they may be incapacitated and unable to press the SOS button.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/pro-app-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Travelsafe\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/travelsafe-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Safer travels\",\"heading\":\"Travelsafe\",\"content\":\"Get staff safely from A to B using our specialised service for journeys. Our unique lone working app feature protects your people throughout their journey, with welfare checks along the way.\",\"linkText\":\"Read about Travelsafe\",\"link\":\"/uk/products/travelsafe/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/pro-app-tab4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Using the best lone worker alarm app\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/1006539119\"} -->\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Timed alarm</strong> – alarm automatically raised if the set activity timer expires</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Check-in and out</strong> – staff can check in and out of their working day or specific activities providing updates on their wellbeing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Voice memo</strong> – leave a voice message of an upcoming activity</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Welfare check</strong> – regular automated welfare checks can be scheduled asking the staff member to confirm they’re okay</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>W3W</strong> – integrated with What3Words to enhance location data to 5m²</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/uk/lone-workers/man-down-alarm/\"><strong>Man down alarm</strong></a> – alarm automatically raised should there be a fall</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Travelsafe\",\"title\":\"Keep your people safe when they travel\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Explore Travelsafe\",\"link\":\"/uk/products/travelsafe/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/915626033\",\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Provide your people with emergency protection on every journey whether they are travelling for work, commuting or in their social lives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Set a destination</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select how you’re travelling</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose welfare check frequency</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add (optional) journey notes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Start Travelsafe</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Roamsafe\",\"title\":\"Get a signal anywhere to call for help\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Explore Roamsafe\",\"link\":\"/uk/products/roamsafe/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/esim-image.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using eSIM technology, you can provide network coverage that is equal to the roaming SIM in a device.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our low signal solution allows workers to call for help, even in:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>remote locations,</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>buildings with poor signal, or</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>areas with unreliable networks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Team Broadcast\",\"title\":\"Instant alerts to keep your team safe\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Explore Team Broadcast\",\"link\":\"/uk/products/team-broadcast/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Team-Broadcast.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Warn and inform your team of critical events through in-app mass broadcasts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Deliver critical messages during emergencies</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instantly inform employees anywhere, anytime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Share urgent updates on facility issues, severe weather, and other critical events</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Crash Detection\",\"title\":\"Extend your road safety protection\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Learn More\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/iStock-1036766502.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instantly extend your duty of care towards employees on the road.*</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Offer greater peace of mind whether you have people making deliveries, travelling between locations or commuting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>*As an Apple developed feature, Crash Detection is exclusively available to iOS users.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"How the best lone worker app works\",\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/1135376582/a4d0227782\",\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 with our <a href=\"/uk/panic-alarms/\">personal panic alarms</a> thanks to rapid connectivity to our dedicated Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC). Our lone working app provides the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/side-tabs {\"title\":\"Best Lone Worker App in action\",\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Delivery Driver Attacked\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA delivery driver was verbally abused and threatened with a garden fork by a customer. The driver had already called police but activated their Peoplesafe Pro app. The controller assessed the situation, contacted the driver’s manager, and stayed on the line with the driver monitoring the situation until police arrived.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/delivery-driver-pro-app-1024x806.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Meter Reader Assaulted\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA meter reader was assaulted and locked in a cupboard by a customer. They activated their Peoplesafe Pro app, and the controller contacted police, providing precise location details. The controller also informed the meter reader’s emergency contacts. Police arrived and rescued the meter reader.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/meter-reader-pro-app-1024x806.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Estate Agent Locked In\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAn estate agent was working in a showroom home when they became stuck inside the bathroom. They raised an alarm, and the controller followed the escalation procedure, getting hold of the secondary contact when the first person listed didn’t answer. The agent’s manager attended the scene to rescue them.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/estate-agent-pro-app-1024x806.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/quote {\"quotes\":[{\"quote\":\"“The Peoplesafe app gives our people an added layer of safety while on the job and particularly for many of our colleagues that work alone for long periods of the day. It also helps us to address an area we have less control: attacks by members of the public.”\",\"attribution\":\"Adam Elsworth, Safety Director\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/openreach-logo-website.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"“Peoplesafe has a history of being the ‘first to market’ and they have led the movement to specific smartphone solutions. With the Peoplesafe app, our staff can utilise existing equipment, which we have already invested in and staff are familiar with, thus reducing costs, but still retaining a high quality of service.”\",\"attribution\":\"Alan Pert, Security Manager\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/first-bus-quote.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"The app is easy to operate and provides staff with the reassurance that if a situation arose in which they felt they were at risk, they have immediate access to a panic alarm to summon help. The Peoplesafe service has greatly enhanced our lone working policy and procedures.”\",\"attribution\":\"Alan Coleman, Project Manager\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/addiction-ni-quote.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"quote\":\"“We employ a number of lone workers from Caretakers to Housing and Anti-social Behaviour Officers. We needed a system that allows a quick and easy way of identifying alarms and locations and ensures they’re acted on quickly. The Peoplesafe app provided the most ideal software and service for this.”\",\"attribution\":\"Myles Kaplan, Head of Estate Services\",\"logo\":0,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/richmond-housing-quote.png@@\",\"logoUrl\":\"\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/logo-slider {\"title\":\"Industries using Peoplesafe’s best lone worker app\",\"logos\":[{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/NHS.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Council.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Housing.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Utilities.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Retail.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Logistics.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Transport.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Estate-Agents.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Charity.jpg@@\"},{\"logo\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Manufacturing.jpg@@\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download eBook\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download eBook\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/pro-app-ebook-download/page/1?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/pro-app-eboook.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the Peoplesafe lone worker app can enhance the safety and security of your workers?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product eBook for detailed information on its exclusive features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover why Peoplesafe was voted the best lone worker app for how it provides reliable protection, rapid response, and advanced technology to ensure your employees are protected in any situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/pro-app-ebook-download/page/1?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download eBook</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Proactively manage people risk\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/nexus-hero-1.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Add people, allocate apps and monitor usage from our award-winning Nexus platform. Connect your staff, managers and our ARC in one place for simple people management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managers have a comprehensive 360º view of an employee’s safety in one location, including contact details, medical information, voice notes and activity timers. You can also see device specific information such as battery life, last known position and serial number.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visually engaging reports provide actionable insights on user engagement with the service so you can make changes to improve personal security.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Our Accreditations</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/image-columns {\"style\":\"cards\",\"items\":[{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/8484.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eBS 8484:2022\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur service is fully accredited against the British Standard for the provision of lone worker devices and service.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/ISO-27001-1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eISO 27001: 2017\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe adhere to information security best practice and deliver the highest standard of data security to our clients.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/cyber-essentials.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eCyber Essentials Plus\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe have the highest certification after being independently assessed to ensure our systems and information are cybersafe.\"},{\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/50518.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"text\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eBS EN 50518:2019\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC) is a category I which is designed, constructed and operated to a higher standard than a category II.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/faq {\"title\":\"Lone Worker App FAQs\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"What is a lone worker app?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA lone worker app is an application that can be downloaded on smartphones designed to protect employees working alone.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"What does a lone worker phone app do?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe most basic function of a lone worker phone app is to raise an SOS alarm when the user needs help, for example if they’re in danger, suffer an injury or feel threatened.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How does a lone working app work?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA lone working app is linked with a 24/7 Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC). When the SOS alarm button is pressed, an alert is raised in the ARC and audio communication is opened between the smartphone and the ARC Controller.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYou can also use a lone worker app to set timers for specific tasks and to check in/out of the working day.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How do I download the lone worker phone app from Peoplesafe?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe Peoplesafe Pro lone worker phone app is available to download from both the Apple Store and the Play Store. Before gaining access to the app’s features, your employer will need to have purchased a subscription.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Peoplesafe lone working app pair with wearable tech?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes – our lone working app can be paired with the Apple Watch so you can call for help without accessing your iPhone.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get the best lone worker app demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2022-12-22/2bh5f4\",\"height\":550} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Alternative solutions\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:mysos@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:mysos-id-badge-4g@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:sos-app@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":2,"types":["safety-apps"]}